1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Select the bank employee role in ScamSafe.


2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Load this fictional report of an impersonation text, disclosed credentials,
and an unfamiliar two-thousand-dollar debit.

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:16,000
Submit the report for AI analysis.
AI processing time shortened.

4
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:21,000
The AI structures the report
and asks three targeted questions.

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Suspected phishing is linked to the reported text,
credentials, and debit.

6
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:31,500
Facts appear in structured fields.
Transaction status remains unknown.

7
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:36,500
Select “Don’t know” when the transaction status is unavailable.


8
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:41,500
End the remaining questions.
Unresolved gaps remain in the case.

9
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:50,000
Review the bank’s suggested response and its fictional guideline reference.
Account and payment concerns require human review.

10
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:53,000
Generate materials from the current case.
AI processing time shortened.

11
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:59,000
Review the case summary,
including reported facts and unresolved information.

12
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:05,000
The explanation for the affected person
summarises the report and suggests next steps.

13
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:12,000
The telecom handover focuses on the suspicious text message.
Review the draft before using it.

14
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:18,000
Edit the summary to flag transaction status for follow-up.
The materials remain drafts.

15
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:22,500
Confirm the reviewed materials
to enable copying and downloading.

16
00:01:22,500 --> 00:01:29,000
Download the summary.
The employee decides the next action through existing organisational processes.
